  UnitStory: "Ho\xE0ng V\u0103n Khoa hay c\xF2n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c bi\u1EBFt \u0111\u1EBFn
    v\u1EDBi c\xE1i t\xEAn PewPew l\xE0 m\u1ED9t trong nh\u1EEFng streamer \u0111\u1EDDi
    \u0111\u1EA7u n\u1ED5i ti\u1EBFng nh\u1EA5t t\u1EA1i Vi\u1EC7t Nam. Anh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    nhi\u1EC1u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi y\xEAu th\xEDch nh\u1EDD phong c\xE1ch n\xF3i chuy\u1EC7n
    h\xE0i h\u01B0\u1EDBc, g\u1EA7n g\u0169i v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng bu\u1ED5i livestream
    game \u0111\u1EA7y gi\u1EA3i tr\xED, \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t l\xE0 Dota 2 v\xE0
    Li\xEAn Minh Huy\u1EC1n Tho\u1EA1i. Kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 n\u1ED5i ti\u1EBFng trong
    c\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1ED3ng game th\u1EE7, PewPew c\xF2n t\u1EA1o d\u1EA5u \u1EA5n
    v\u1EDBi nhi\u1EC1u c\xE2u n\xF3i viral v\xE0 c\xE1c talkshow mang phong c\xE1ch
    ch\xE2n th\u1EADt, tho\u1EA3i m\xE1i. Sau nhi\u1EC1u n\u0103m ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng,
    anh d\u1EA7n chuy\u1EC3n h\u01B0\u1EDBng sang kinh doanh nh\u01B0ng v\u1EABn
    l\xE0 m\u1ED9t c\xE1i t\xEAn quen thu\u1ED9c trong v\u0103n h\xF3a Internet Vi\u1EC7t
    Nam."
